:[{"id":"c1","text":"Nam's"},{"id":"c2","text":"Mai's"},{"id":"c3","text":"Anna's"}],"passage":"Saturday is Mai's birthday. Her friends want to celebrate, but it is a secret. Mai is a little sad because nobody says \"Happy birthday\" in the morning. She is bored at home. In the evening, Linh calls her: \"Come to the café, please.\" When Mai arrives, all her friends are there: Nam, Tom, Anna and Mr. Long. \"Surprise!\" they shout. Mai is very surprised and happy. Nam is funny and dances on a chair. Mrs. Rosa brings a big cake. \"Thank you for inviting me to my own party!\" Mai laughs.","question":"Whose birthday is it?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"Mai's\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c2","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Bữa tiệc bất ngờ\".","id":"u15n4l1-e01","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"Whose birthday is it?"},"skillIds":["reading","u15.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"She is sick."},{"id":"c2","text":"Nobody says \"Happy birthday.\""},{"id":"c3","text":"It is raining."}],"passage":"Saturday is Mai's birthday. Her friends want to celebrate, but it is a secret. Mai is a little sad because nobody says \"Happy birthday\" in the morning. She is bored at home. In the evening, Linh calls her: \"Come to the café, please.\" When Mai arrives, all her friends are there: Nam, Tom, Anna and Mr. Long. \"Surprise!\" they shout. Mai is very surprised and happy. Nam is funny and dances on a chair. Mrs. Rosa brings a big cake. \"Thank you for inviting me to my own party!\" Mai laughs.","question":"Why is Mai sad in the morning?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"Nobody says \"Happy birthday.\"\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c2","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Bữa tiệc bất ngờ\".","id":"u15n4l1-e02","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"Why is Mai sad in the morning?"},"skillIds"